<p>You mix together your munitions, leading to powerful new effects:</p><p>Incendiary - Targets struck by the explosion have their armor and saves reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 11, 17, 20, 22</acronym> for 3 turns, and your physical and fire penetration is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 14%, 17%, 20%, 22%.</acronym></p><p>Venomous - Shots deal an additional <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">23%, 28%, 33%, 36%, 40%</acronym> weapon damage as nature in a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 2</acronym> ball, which applies numbing poison as per Exotic Munitions. This cannot occur more than once per turn.</p><p>Piercing - Shots deal <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>physical power 100">22, 29, 35, 40, 44</acronym> physical damage and maim the target, bleeding them for a further <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>physical power 100">108, 146, 175, 200, 222</acronym> physical damage over 5 turns and reducing all damage dealt by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 12%, 15%, 16%, 18%.</acronym></p><p>The physical damage dealt, armor penetration and save reduction will increase with your Physical Power.</p>